{
  "uid": "vellun-whatsapp",
  "title": "Vellun — Pipeline WhatsApp",
  "description": "Funil do webhook ao lançamento criado. É o dashboard linkado pelos alertas do pipeline.",
  "tags": ["vellun", "operacoes", "whatsapp"],
  "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Métricas",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up, env)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Funil",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Entrada e publicação",
      "description": "Divergência entre recebido e publicado indica mensagem descartada antes de publicar (longa demais, ou payload sem mensagem). `publish_failed` significa 503 no webhook — a Meta vai reenviar, com limite.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_webhook_received_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "recebido/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_publish_confirmed_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "publicado/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_publish_failed_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "falha de publicação/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_webhook_ignored_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ignorado/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "falha de publicação/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumo e processamento",
      "description": "`duplicadas` altas são normais após um reenvio da Meta; sustentadas indicam ack lento. `deferred` alto significa muita mensagem simultânea do mesmo número (lock de telefone).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_messages_consumed_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "consumido/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_jobs_processed_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "jobs processados/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_messages_duplicated_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "duplicadas/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_jobs_deferred_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "adiados por lock/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vellun_agent_processing_error_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "erro de processamento/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "erro de processamento/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Filas",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Profundidade por fila",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "rabbitmq_detailed_queue_messages_ready{env=\"$env\", queue=~\"whatsapp\\\\..*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumidores por fila",
      "description": "As filas de retry têm zero consumidor por construção: o TTL devolve a mensagem à fila principal. Zero nas filas `.v1` com mensagem pendente é incidente.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "rabbitmq_detailed_queue_consumers{env=\"$env\", queue=~\"whatsapp\\\\.(inbound|processing)\\\\.v1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Falha definitiva",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DLQ: profundidade da fila vs. catálogo",
      "description": "O par que expõe divergência. A DLQ é transporte; o Postgres (`ops_failed_messages`) é a fonte de verdade do que falhou. Com o catálogo saudável a linha da fila fica rente a zero — o consumer drena em segundos — enquanto o contador do catálogo sobe. Fila acima de zero de forma sustentada significa que o consumer parou: nada se perde, mas o painel de operações passa a mostrar MENOS falhas do que existem.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_detailed_queue_messages_ready{env=\"$env\", queue=~\"whatsapp\\\\..*\\\\.dlq\"})",
          "legendFormat": "parado na DLQ"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(increase(vellun_agent_dlq_catalog_captured_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "catalogado (5m)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(increase(vellun_agent_dlq_catalog_failed_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "falha ao catalogar (5m)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "falha ao catalogar (5m)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Entradas em DLQ",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(vellun_agent_dlq_total{env=\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "novas entradas (5m)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "drawStyle": "bars"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latência",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência do webhook (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "description": "Inclui o publisher confirm do RabbitMQ, que é justamente a garantia que o 202 representa. Subida sustentada = broker sob pressão.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(vellun_agent_webhook_latency_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(vellun_agent_webhook_latency_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(vellun_agent_webhook_latency_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Recebimento até processamento (p95)",
      "description": "Inclui o debounce de 5s do agrupamento, então o piso é ~5s por construção.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 25
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(vellun_agent_receive_to_process_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\"}[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Processamento e LLM (p95)",
      "description": "O processamento é dominado pela latência do LLM; as duas linhas juntas mostram quanto do tempo é nosso.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 25
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(vellun_agent_processing_duration_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\"}[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "processamento p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(vellun_agent_llm_latency_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\"}[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "LLM p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
